WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.571
Hello Mrs Martin,

00:00:01.821 --> 00:00:11.487
My name is Tom Becker. I am sixteen and I live in Munich, in Germany. In July, I am going to stay with you for three weeks to learn French.

00:00:11.737 --> 00:00:21.077
I have a sister, Anna. She is twelve. My father is a maths teacher and my mother works in a hospital. We have a dog, Bruno.

00:00:21.327 --> 00:00:28.691
I like football and music. I have been playing the guitar for two years. I eat everything, but I don't like fish.

00:00:28.941 --> 00:00:34.392
Do you live near the sea? And is there a language school in your town?

00:00:34.642 --> 00:00:36.443
See you soon,
Tom
